// Title: Tomcat WebServer Logs Deleted
// ID: 270185ff-5f50-4d6d-a27f-24c3b8c9fef8
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-02-16
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1070
// Description: Detects the deletion of tomcat WebServer logs which may indicate an attempt to destroy forensic evidence
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(TargetFilename ICONTAINS "\\Tomcat") AND where(TargetFilename ICONTAINS "\\logs\\")) AND (where(TargetFilename ICONTAINS "catalina.") OR where(TargetFilename ICONTAINS "_access_log.") OR where(TargetFilename ICONTAINS "localhost.")))
